            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.1+1SA.31.2+1SA.31.3+1SA.31.4+1SA.31.5+1SA.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31.1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.10.1+1CH.10.2+1CH.10.3+1CH.10.4+1CH.10.5+1CH.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Od-dur 10.1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inni waan jed'eeni, Anini ka gaara Gilboa ira jiru, Saulo ka woraana isati hirkatufi gaarifi worri farda yaabatu ka nyaapa ka diquma isa hanqatu arge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni garagale na arge, na yaame, jennaani anini jala owaad'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni, Atini eenu? Jed'e na gaafate; jennaani, Anini nama gosa Amaleki jed'eeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni waan nani jed'e, Kooti, na ijeesi, anini guddo madae dandami inqabu diquma inch'ichini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani anini d'ufe isa ijeese wonti akanatiifi anini imbeekha aka inni yo lafa d'ae ira inhamne. Jennaani anini sure isaa ta hayyu mata iraa fuud'e, harbora harka iraa yaase, amma sitiini d'ufe, aabbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Daudifi jari isaa ch'ufti aka hama laalefatani woya ufi tatarsaasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri laalefate bohe guyya suni ch'ufa agabu oole, maro lubbu Saulotifi ta ilma isaa Yonathanitifi, ammalle worra AABBO Waaqa ka Israeli, ka had'iisa suni keesa duetifi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini namicha kaimiticha qonqooni d'ufe kaani, Atini eesaa d'ufte? jed'e gaafate. Inni waan jed'eeni, Anini nama Amalekiti ammo amma tana namuma lafa teesaniti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini waan jed'eeni, Atini akami hayyu AABBO Waaqi muude ijeesu insodatini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Daudini jara isaa keesa nama toko yaame, kooti isaa ijeesi! jed'eeni. Jennaani namichi namicha Amaleki kaani woraane ijeese, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini waan jed'eeni, Sumati dua tana ufitini d'ufe. Afaanuma keetiini atini, hayyu AABBO Waaqi muude anumati ijeese jette.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Daudini Saulofi Yonathani faarse bohe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini Saulofi ilma isa Yonathani faaru taanaani faarse bohe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.10.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 10.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " faaru tana worra Yuda ch'ufa ha barsiisani jed'e. (Faaru suni kitaaba Yashari keesati t'aafani.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Daudi hayyu Yuda tolchani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
